                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I don't remember when or where I bought this game. But here are some of my thoughts after trying it as part of \"clearing\" my library:\n\n* Calling it \"Chess in Space\" isn't wrong, although the win condition is very different.\n* It could be better or more interesting as a physical board game.\n* The native Linux version doesn't work on my device. I had to enable Proton (which means using the Windows version).\n* I wish there were an option to reduce animation time after I or the enemy take an action.\n\nP.S. I neither \"recommend\" nor \"don't recommend\" it, because I don't play enough games to give an opinion about the balance of each unit or the bot patterns.",
